  "label": "User projected onto the ironic textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'partial arts' because the meme's humor and intent rely on the user interpreting the text as a direct commentary on the visual scene. The user must mentally map the text to the visual depiction of the martial artists to understand the joke and its implied disrespect. The projection is onto the text_chunk entity, as the user's understanding of the meme's meaning is anchored in the textual pun and its ironic contrast with the visual material.",
